# CLOCK SEAMS (checklist class 60) — the maintained list of TIME-DEPENDENT RULES.
#
# Format:  <file>:<entry point>:<…At variant>
#
# Every rule whose verdict can change with the wall clock belongs here. The lint
# test (trader/clock_seam_lint_test.go) reads THIS FILE and asserts, for each
# row, that the …At variant exists and that the entry point is a ONE-LINE
# DELEGATE. Adding a time-dependent rule without a seam fails the build.
#
# Class 60 in one line: a suite verified at 11:00 was red at 14:50 because a
# fixed-fixture test reached a wall-clock entry point. The entry owns the clock;
# the rule takes it as an argument.
#
# NOT in this list, deliberately — with the reason, because an unexplained
# absence is how a list stops being trusted:
#   trader/auto_trader_reset.go ForceReset — its time.Now() is a poll DEADLINE
#     for a real wait on an in-flight read, not a rule. Feeding it fixture time
#     would change behaviour (instant timeout or none), which this wave forbids.
#   trader/auto_trader_clock.go tickOnce — the loop entry. Its only clock use
#     already delegates to the seamed staleDodgeCheck(now).
#   kernel/tz.go NowCT — the clock accessor itself; every consumer (ClockCT,
#     ClockCTAndUTC, ClockCTSeconds, TableTimeCT) already takes an explicit t.
#   trader/binance/order_sync.go — live-network request timestamps, env-gated
#     tests (BINANCE_LIVE_TEST), not in the deploy gate.

trader/auto_trader_clock.go:latestClosedPrimaryBarMs:latestClosedPrimaryBarMsAt
trader/auto_trader_clock.go:recordClosedTradeAnalytics:recordClosedTradeAnalyticsAt
trader/auto_trader_clock.go:maybeRecordClosedTradeAnalytics:maybeRecordClosedTradeAnalyticsAt
trader/auto_trader_clock.go:entryBlockedByLastEntry:entryBlockedByLastEntryAt
trader/auto_trader_clock.go:enforceEODFlat:enforceEODFlatAt
trader/auto_trader_clock.go:enforceT1ForceFlat:enforceT1ForceFlatAt
trader/auto_trader_transition.go:observeTransitionStanddown:observeTransitionStanddownAt
trader/auto_trader_transition.go:maybeWakePlannerOnMSS:maybeWakePlannerOnMSSAt
trader/auto_trader_weekly.go:weeklyConfluenceShadow:weeklyConfluenceShadowAt
trader/auto_trader_weekly.go:weeklyScenarioGrade:weeklyScenarioGradeAt
trader/auto_trader_wake_levels.go:maybeWakePlannerOnLevelEvents:maybeWakePlannerOnLevelEventsAt
kernel/risk_limits.go:ResetDailyPnL:ResetDailyPnLAt
provider/ninjatrader/bar_persist.go:barPersistSummary:barPersistSummaryAt

trader/auto_trader_levelstate.go:recordLevelState:recordLevelStateAt
trader/auto_trader_levelstate.go:recordScenarioState:recordScenarioStateAt
trader/auto_trader_planner.go:runPlannerReadCoreWithFactsGrades:runPlannerReadCoreWithFactsGradesClock
trader/invalidation_resolver.go:scenarioInvalidationResolver:scenarioInvalidationResolverClock

trader/armed_executor.go:declineHadFreshMet:declineHadFreshMetAt
trader/armed_executor.go:maybeManageArmedOrders:maybeManageArmedOrdersAt

# Stage A telemetry clocks (no trading verdict changes)
researchsnapshot/archive.go:Save:saveAt
researchsnapshot/recorder.go:Offer:offerWithClock
